1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
A batch, its tests, a deviation, and follow-up actions belong in one
review trail.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:16,000
In this fictional audit log, a test value changes but the reason is
blank. Look at the original event.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Search a flagged event, open its source row, and record your review. A
flag is not a violation verdict.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Compare several as-of dates to see which actions became overdue or were
resolved.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:40,000
BatchScope uses synthetic records for this demonstration. Download the
desktop app and try the included example.
